d.getMinutes();

Try it Yourself »

const d = new Date();

d.getMinutes();

Try it Yourself »

The getSeconds() method returns the seconds of a date as a number (0-59):

Examples

const d = new Date("2021-03-25");

d.getSeconds();

Try it Yourself »

