Try it Yourself »

x(?=y) matches "x" if "x" is followed by "y".

Example
Match "W3schools" if "W3Schools" is followed by " Tutorials".

let text = "W3Schools Tutorials";

let pattern = /W3Schools(?= Tutorials)/;

