 (click)="increment()": Calls the component method to increase the count.

 (input)="onInput($event)": Reads the input's current text from $event.target.value and stores it in value.

 (keyup)="lastKey = $any($event).key": Stores the last pressed key in lastKey.

 Display: {{ count }}, {{ value }}, and {{ lastKey }} show the component fields.

