Control Flow Basics
Toggle content with @if ...; else.

Iterate with @for and add a track expression for stable DOM updates.

 @if (show) { <p>Visible</p> } @else { <p>Hidden</p> }

@for (item of items; track item) { <li>{{ item }}</li> }

